x;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"background-color: #4687ff;border-radius: 0px 7px;padding: 6px 25px;box-sizing:border-box;transform: translateZ(5px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(5px);-moz-transform: translateZ(5px);-o-transform: translateZ(5px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;color: #f7f7f7;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 19px;\"><strong>加大&ldquo;统&rdquo;的力度</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;color: #f7f7f7;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 19px;\"><strong>强化顶层设计推进应用协同</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 40px;margin-left: auto;margin-top: -26px;margin-right: -15px;box-sizing:border-box;transform: translateZ(7px);-webkit-transform: translateZ(7px);-moz-transform: translateZ(7px);-o-transform: translateZ(7px);\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"display: block;\" viewbox=\"0 0 75.29 55\" xml:space=\"default\"><g data-name=\"图层 2\"><g data-name=\"图层 1\"><g><path d=\"M11.87,55H8.79S1.42,54.81,0,48.77H24.64L20.08,55Z\" style=\"fill:#d48d12;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M11.36,55s13.6.58,23.56-25.79l23.75-.3S53.93,53.18,40.61,55Z\" style=\"fill:#ffd427;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M49.83,0,75.29,30.09H19.93Z\" style=\"fill:#ffd427;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g></g></g></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"121531\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 15px 10px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;margin: -1px 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"297\" data-backw=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"100013502\" data-ratio=\"0.5444444444444444\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202503/2-3.png\" style=\"width: 1700px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; height: 926px;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在顶层设计上统。</strong></span>结合广东省实际研究建立数字住建业务谱系，完成596项业务事项梳理，着力构建&ldquo;1+4&rdquo;（即&ldquo;一个支撑底座，四大业务板块集成应用&rdquo;）的数字化总体框架。明确各业务板块涵盖模块以及数据来源和需求，由分到总开展规划设计和方案编制，分批分阶段推进信息系统综合集成、整合共享。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在省市协同上统。</strong></span>统筹省市一体化建设，在业务逻辑相对一致且信息化普及程度不高的事项上，纵向建设全省垂直管理系统供各地使用，同时鼓励各地个性化创新。在业务逻辑和业务流程明显区别的事项上，推动标准先行，统一数据标准，做好省市两级系统联动对接。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在推广应用上统。</strong></span>在全省住房城乡建设系统大力推广&ldquo;一地创新、多地复用&rdquo;的粤复用模式。将深圳建设的建筑垃圾监管平台推广应用至广州、珠海等地；将佛山建设的绿色建材采信应用系统升级为省平台，在全省推广应用；依托广州市房屋安全管理系统搭建全省房屋建筑综合管理平台供各地区使用，实现全省住建系统数字化资源优化配置，节约财政资金，缩小区域差距，提升数字化建设整体水平。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"140207\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;display: flex;justify-content: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-left: -10px;margin-bottom: -13px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;margin-top: 2px;margin-bottom: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 5px;height: 5px;border-radius: 100%;background-color: #ffdd72;margin-right: 2px;margin-left: 2px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\