venodd;\"></path></g></g></g></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"121531\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 15px 10px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;margin: -1px 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"273\" data-backw=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"100013503\" data-ratio=\"0.49907407407407406\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202503/2-4.png\" style=\"width: 100%; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\">业务上联通。</span></strong>以数字住建数据资源中心为基础底座，结合全国自然灾害综合风险普查数据成果，开展统一房屋建筑编码、工程项目代码等编码管理，制定统一标准，贯通工程建设项目全生命周期，创新业务管理模式，实现数字化协同管理。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>部门间互通。</strong></span>全面推行首席数据官制度，与公安、民政、自然资源等多部门共享数据资源。截至目前，广东省住房和城乡建设厅在省&ldquo;一网共享&rdquo;平台共发布282个数据类，累计1.45亿条数据，涵盖各业务领域。共满足230个单位数据共享需求2684个，申请应用了41个单位的583个数据类，进一步强化了数据的共享共用，有效支撑政务服务&ldquo;少填少报&rdquo;&ldquo;秒批秒办&rdquo;等多种创新应用。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>纵向上贯通。</strong></span>遵循住房城乡建设部标准体系，通过各层级住建业务系统预留对上、对下数据接口，在统一的授权之下，上层业务系统可自动抓取下层业务系统的数据，下层也可获取自身需要的上层数据，实现各层级信息系统间的互联互通。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"140207\" data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;display: flex;justify-content: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-st