pace=\"default\"><g data-name=\"图层 2\"><g data-name=\"图层 1\"><g><path d=\"M11.87,55H8.79S1.42,54.81,0,48.77H24.64L20.08,55Z\" style=\"fill:#d48d12;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M11.36,55s13.6.58,23.56-25.79l23.75-.3S53.93,53.18,40.61,55Z\" style=\"fill:#ffd427;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g><g><path d=\"M49.83,0,75.29,30.09H19.93Z\" style=\"fill:#ffd427;fill-rule:evenodd;\"></path></g></g></g></svg></section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section class=\"_135editor\" data-id=\"121531\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 15px 10px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;margin: -1px 5px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-backh=\"153\" data-backw=\"546\" data-imgfileid=\"100013504\" data-ratio=\"0.28055555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202503/2-5.png\" style=\"width: 1200px; vertical-align: baseline; box-sizing: border-box; height: 337px;\" /></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在公共支撑上聚合。</strong></span>充分应用广东数字政府改革建设成果，构建支撑底座实现统一数据资源中心、统一门户、统一地图服务等9个公共基础支撑能力。结合全国自然灾害综合风险普查数据成果，打造全省统一的行业数据底座，构建&ldquo;一网统管&rdquo;主题库19个、专题库150个、数据指标2460个。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在平台功能上耦合。</strong></span>从信息化项目立项源头严格把关，把各业务系统的大屏、小屏等建设需求整合集成到&ldquo;一网统管&rdquo;住房城乡建设专题中，对一些分散、独立的业务信息平台进行整合，撤&ldquo;篱笆&rdquo;，平&ldquo;烟囱&rdquo;，使新老平台、多散小系统有效整合，以互联互通互操作的功能逐步实现平台数量的压缩。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-indent: 2.17647em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(31, 102, 176);\"><strong>在安全保障上整合。</strong></span>统筹指导网络、数据和密码安全保障，不断完善制度机制。按照&ldquo;管行业必须管安全&rdquo;的要求，建立全省住房城乡建设系统应急机制，开展网络安全意识和网络安全技术培训，及时共享网络安全预警通报。强化日常监测及应急演练，2024年8月，广东省住房和城乡建设厅组织参加&ldquo;粤盾-2024&rdquo;广东省数字政府网络安全实战攻防演练，获评&ldquo;优秀防守单位&rdquo;。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-end;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"flex-shrink: 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 6px;height: 6px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #4687ff;box-sizing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>"}